/T (Handwashing is essential in the prevention of disease and illness. Wash your hands after each episode of care and after taking off gloves. When a sink is not available, use hand sanitizers. \(Most hand sanitizers are alcohol-based and are a substitute for handwashing when needed.\) )
/E (Handwashing is essential in the prevention of disease and illness. Wash your hands after each episode of care and after taking off gloves. When a sink is not available, use hand sanitizers. \(Most hand sanitizers are alcohol-based and are a substitute for handwashing when needed.\) )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
