<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 571 0 R
/T (Heart disease remains the leading cause of death in the United States. Your prompt actions can mean the difference between life and death during a heart attack. If the person is experiencing a heart attack, blocked blood flow to the heart tissue results in muscle death. \(Keep in mind the mantra: Time Is Muscle.\) Prompt response and medical attention are critical in limiting damage to the heart muscle.  )
/E (Heart disease remains the leading cause of death in the United States. Your prompt actions can mean the difference between life and death during a heart attack. If the person is experiencing a heart attack, blocked blood flow to the heart tissue results in muscle death. \(Keep in mind the mantra: Time Is Muscle.\) Prompt response and medical attention are critical in limiting damage to the heart muscle.  )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
