/P 571 0 R
/T (Chest discomfort can be described as an ache, pressure, squeezing, or a crushing pain. Certain  persons such as women and people with diabetes are less likely to have classic signs of a heart attack.  These individuals may simply experience nausea or unexplained fatigue. Shortness of breath could  be the only sign of an impending heart attack for some individuals.)
/E (Chest discomfort can be described as an ache, pressure, squeezing, or a crushing pain. Certain  persons such as women and people with diabetes are less likely to have classic signs of a heart attack.  These individuals may simply experience nausea or unexplained fatigue. Shortness of breath could  be the only sign of an impending heart attack for some individuals.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [9]
>>
