/T (Common eye injuries can result from direct blows, foreign bodies, or  inadvertent scratching of the eye. Symptoms include immediate pain,  tearing, changing vision, and redness. Bruising and bleeding can also  occur. More serious injuries include punctures and lacerations.)
/E (Common eye injuries can result from direct blows, foreign bodies, or  inadvertent scratching of the eye. Symptoms include immediate pain,  tearing, changing vision, and redness. Bruising and bleeding can also  occur. More serious injuries include punctures and lacerations.)
