/T (Turn the power on. Expose the chest \(Figure 17a\). Apply pads on the victim \(Figure 17b\). Connect the pads. Clear the person to make sure no one is touching  any part of the victim \(Figure 17c\). Let the AED analyze the rhythm. Follow the prompts such as \(Figure 17d\): Shock  Advised, No Shock Advised, Check  Connection, etc. Resume CPR with compressions.)
/E (Turn the power on. Expose the chest \(Figure 17a\). Apply pads on the victim \(Figure 17b\). Connect the pads. Clear the person to make sure no one is touching  any part of the victim \(Figure 17c\). Let the AED analyze the rhythm. Follow the prompts such as \(Figure 17d\): Shock  Advised, No Shock Advised, Check  Connection, etc. Resume CPR with compressions.)
