<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 602 0 R
/T (Choking can be mild or severe. If the child can make sounds and cough, the airway is mildly blocked. Stand near them and encourage them to cough. Call 911/EMS immediately if you are worried about their breathing. Severe signs of blockage include the inability to breathe, coughing without making a sound, inability to  speak, or the universal choking sign. In any of these cases, immediate action is required. Table 2 will help determine whether the choking is mild or severe. )
/E (Choking can be mild or severe. If the child can make sounds and cough, the airway is mildly blocked. Stand near them and encourage them to cough. Call 911/EMS immediately if you are worried about their breathing. Severe signs of blockage include the inability to breathe, coughing without making a sound, inability to  speak, or the universal choking sign. In any of these cases, immediate action is required. Table 2 will help determine whether the choking is mild or severe. )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [5]
>>
