/T (Very small wounds such as scrapes can heal more rapidly by using an antibiotic salve. Ask the  person if they have any allergies before applying the antibiotic salve. If they do have allergies,  do not apply the salve. Thoroughly wash minor scrapes and abrasions with soap and water  before bandaging.)
